        "date": "2026-11-18T11:19:58Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge main into issue/2065-theme-dropdown-tokens-uma\n\nHand-resolved files:\n- panes.rs: the operation dropdown keeps main's 16 px kind icon and\n  takes its inset, size and label clearance from the shared menu\n  metrics (DropGeom::clip_inset_x, icon_px, icon_text_x); without an\n  icon the label sits at the theme row padding. Defaults give main's\n  4 / 16 / 28 exactly. The test-only DROP_GAP is dropped (its users\n  left with main's tab-strip test).\n- recent_drop.rs: main's Examples row plus the PR's fitted width.\n- tests.rs: main's workspace-tab test replaces the machine-door test;\n  both module lists kept.\n- theme.rs, theme/tables.rs, theme/clamp.rs, theme_files.rs,\n  theme_files/names.rs, theme_files/overlay.rs, theme.json.example:\n  main's split modules and newer tokens kept; the four menu tokens\n  added to each.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
