      "message": "test(ui): pin the operation dropdown icon clearance to the menu metrics\n\nThe merge of main brought the kind icon into the operation dropdown\nrows. The pins prove that, with the icon set loaded, the icon inset,\nthe icon size and the label x come from the shared menu metrics: the\ndefault theme keeps 4 / 16 / 28, and menu_pad_x 16 gives 8 / 16 / 40\nwith the label clear of the icon. The section-row assertion of\nall_dropdown_drawers_follow_theme_tokens now expects the icon\nclearance. The decision file records the hand resolution.\n\nRefs #2065\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
